{"availability":"available","full":"Socialpranker/token-history","name":"token-history","description":"The daily history of which AI agents & models the world actually USES (paid tokens, not buyable stars). Archive of OpenRouter rankings + compare charts, README badges, overtake & decline alerts, weekly digest. Stars only go up — these lines can fall.","category":"Developer tools","language":"JavaScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-06-10T12:36:29Z","updated":"2026-10-17T19:41:57Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://socialpranker.github.io/token-history/","topics":["ai-agents","analytics","dataset","git-scraping","github-pages","leaderboard","llm","openrouter","rankings","token-usage"],"demo":"https://socialpranker.github.io/token-history/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T22:40:56.603Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-17T22:40:56.603Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-17T22:40:56.603Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T07:04:27.532Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-16T00:53:09.592Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-17T22:40:56.603Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["The first AI-agent leaderboard where lines can go down.","Every public metric for AI agents is a ratchet. GitHub stars never decay. Download counts only grow. A benchmark score is a photo taken once. Six months after launch, a dead agent looks identical to a thriving one — and the metric everyone screens by is openly for sale at $0.10–$2.00 a star (6M fake stars found; ICSE 2026).","Token usage is the one public signal with a heartbeat: somebody pays for every token, every week, or the line falls. In May 2026, Hermes Agent overtook OpenClaw in real usage with half the stars — the star charts never moved, and the flip went mostly unnoticed for days."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Socialpranker/token-history/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"1162fd122a69bea97ccb9abf92954f75f6de2d838f6f